1947:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  * @return ERR_OK if request was OK and hs has been initialized correctly
1948:./lwip-2.1.2/src/apps/http/httpd.c ****  *         ERR_INPROGRESS if request was OK so far but not fully received
